    "background_story": "Ander was a brilliant engineer who grew up in the quaint town of Kettering, England. As a child, he spent hours exploring the town's rich history, fascinated by the stories of its industrial past. Inspired by the innovative spirit of the town's founders, Ander pursued a career in mechanical engineering. He spent years working on a revolutionary new design for a sustainable engine, pouring over blueprints and testing prototypes in his Kettering workshop. After years of perseverance, Ander's design was finally recognized by a leading industry publication, earning him international acclaim. He returned to Kettering a hero, proud to have brought recognition to his hometown and inspiring a new generation of engineers to follow in his footsteps.",
